Razer DeathAdder 2000, retail edition (1532:005F)

From https://github.com/openrazer/openrazer/pull/2931 by ZhangMing520 (head
f8e8eced5b4aeb4b3e13cabdf95d230a69b84754), open upstream since 2026-10-02 and
tested there on the mouse itself: the same model as the DeathAdder 2000
upstream already has (RZ01-0145, 1532:004F) under a second product id, on the
same code path.  Rebased onto master 477f4d6 with the Pro Type Ultra patch
applied.  Only the driver and daemon files the generators read are kept; the
README, udev, appstream and fake-driver hunks are left out.

Delete this file once upstream master carries the pull request.

